source: crates/tui/src/agents_center/tests.rs
expression: "screen(&mut center, 100, 24)"
---
  Agent command center  Group: Status  g
   All 3    Needs you 1    Working 1    Ready 0    Inactive 1    Archived
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Keys

  up, down, k, j                 Move; past an end, to the other end
  page-up, page-down, home, end  Move a page, or to the first or last
  enter, right                   Open the session (restore it under Archived)
  tab, shift-tab, 1–6            Filter: All, Needs you, Working, Ready, Inactive, Archived
  esc, q                         Back
  n                              Start a new session
  w                              Start a new session in a new worktree
  f                              Fork the session
  r                              Rename the session
  x                              Interrupt the session's turn
  a                              Archive the session, or restore it under Archived
  backspace                      Delete the session
  f3, /                          Search the sessions' titles
  g                              Group by project, directory, status or model




  esc back
